      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجُورٌ</span></b>  <i>Fuel with which an oven</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنُّور</span>) <i>is heated;</i>
(S, A, Mgh, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْجَرٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْجَرَةٌ</span></b> .
(TA). [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْجَرَةٌ</span> below.]

